# w7fix-combat: target legality and the P hotkey in real play.
# W7-02-01 / W7-07-13 force-fire on own units (Ivan bomb on an own tank,
# AttackCursorOnFriendlies), W7-02-11 no bomb cursor on a bombed target,
# W7-02-02 Tesla Troopers ordered onto an own coil charge it,
# W7-01-13 / W7-02-07 Select Combatants reads IsSelectableCombatant.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:country0
click list:down
click list:down
click list:down
click pick:Iraq
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click check:crates
click slider:units=0
click slider:speed=2
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:SMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,NACNST) == 1
cheat reveal
# --- T1 Ivan over an own tank: the bomb (attack) cursor; a plain click plants
cheat spawn IVAN 0 building 0:NACNST +6 +4
cheat spawn HTNK 0 building 0:NACNST +8 +4
wait 2
click unit 0:IVAN
wait 1
move unit 0:HTNK
wait 2
assert cursor == 6 @W7-02-01
click unit 0:HTNK
until 120 bombs >= 1 @W7-02-01
# --- T1c the bombed tank: no bomb cursor any more (NoIvanBomb)
click unit 0:IVAN
wait 1
move unit 0:HTNK
wait 2
assert cursor != 6 @W7-02-11
# --- T2 Tesla Troopers onto an own Tesla Coil: attack cursor, they charge it
cheat place TESLA 0 building 0:NACNST -6 +6
cheat spawn SHK 0 building 0:NACNST -2 +3
wait 2
# (a selected Ivan would bomb the trooper: AttackCursorOnFriendlies) -- deselect
click unit 0:SHK right
wait 1
click unit 0:SHK
wait 1
move building 0:TESLA
wait 2
assert cursor == 6 @W7-02-02
assert selected_type(SHK) >= 1
click building 0:TESLA
wait 2
assert selected_type(SHK) >= 1 @W7-02-02
until 300 overpowerers >= 1 @W7-02-02
# --- T3 Select Combatants: engineers and terrorists stay out
cheat spawn SENGINEER 0 building 0:NACNST +3 +3
cheat spawn TERROR 0 building 0:NACNST +4 +3
cheat spawn E2 0 building 0:NACNST +5 +3
wait 2
key p
wait 2
assert selected_type(SENGINEER) == 0 @W7-02-07
assert selected_type(TERROR) == 0 @W7-02-07
assert selected_type(E2) >= 1 @W7-01-13
end
